  <item>
    <title>vol.30 指路｜当跑团成为一种运动方式</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/646cd7cb5b0cccd0f4bcb20f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">646cd7cb5b0cccd0f4bcb20f</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 23 May 2023 15:04:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>作为一名视障者，你是否有运动的习惯呢？是否常常为选择何种运动而感到烦恼？很多人都会推荐加入跑团和一群人一起跑步，这是否是一种理想的选择呢？</span></p><br><p><span>本期播客节目邀请到了拥有</span><strong><span>多年跑团经验的资深视障跑者Jimmy</span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span>刚加入跑团的新手志峰</span></strong><span>，与你分享他们的</span><strong><span>跑团体验</span></strong><span>。如果你对跑步感兴趣，想要了解视障人在跑团中跑步的情况，这一期节目一定能够解答你的一些疑问。</span></p><br><p><span>更希望你，从此也迈出脚步，实现自己的运动梦！</span></p><br><p><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong><strong><span>：</span></strong><strong><span>逸云</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>Jimmy，</span></strong><span>深圳U跑团资深跑者，现为跑团教练；</span></p><p><strong><span>志锋，</span></strong><span>以声知远播客成员，新手跑者。</span></p><br><p><strong><span>收听提示</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">02:17</a>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>为什么参加跑团</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">05:27</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;第一次参加跑团的经历</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;跑者和陪跑员的配搭</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="572">09:32</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;跑团的实用小工具——领跑绳</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="808">13:28</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;不仅仅是跑者：从跑者变身陪跑员和教练</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="892">14:52</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;从跑团新人到马拉松选手</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;陪跑员的多重属性</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">20:42</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;跑团给人带来的改变</span></p><br><br>]]></description>
